<title>SRI LANKA: Vanik six-month net plummets.</title>
<headline>Vanik six-month net plummets.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results for the six months ended June 30, 1996:</p>
<p>		(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>				     1996		    1995</p>
<p>    Turnover		    447.95    vs	  321.26</p>
<p>    Net profit		   11.33    vs	   70.45</p>
<p>    Tax			     0.99    vs	    1.77</p>
<p>NOTE - Vanik Inc Ltd, an investment bank, said the profit fall was due to a slowdown in economic activities caused by rising defence spendings and a drought.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
